[[:db/add "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6" :answer/id #uuid "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6"] [:db/add "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6" :answer/value "\\frac{\\ln(15)-9}{3}"] [:db/ensure "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b" :answer-field/id #uuid "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b"] [:db/add "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b" :answer-field/choices "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6"] [:db/add "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b" :answer-field/correct "3fe295dc-42be-5410-9879-ca4e8b0d06b6"] [:db/ensure "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5" :question/id #uuid "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5"] [:db/add "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5" :question/problem "Find the **exact** solution of the equation $e^{3t+9}=15.$\n\n$t=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{3t+9}&=15 \\\\ \\ln(e^{3t+9})&=\\ln(15)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n3t+9=\\ln(15).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $t,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3t+9&=\\ln(15) \\\\ 3t&=\\ln(15)-9 \\\\ t&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\ln(15)-9\\right) \\\\ t&=-3+\\frac{1}{3}\\ln(15)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $t=-3+\\frac{1}{3}\\ln(15).$"] [:db/add "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5" :question/answer-fields "2d88a33d-d45c-582d-8283-57add652b29b"] [:db/ensure "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/questions "2173e1ab-fd0e-53d9-84cc-76ed56aa32a5"] [:db/add "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19" :answer/id #uuid "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19"] [:db/add "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19" :answer/value "\\frac{\\ln(25)-4}{4}"] [:db/ensure "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19" :answer/validate] [:db/add "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4" :answer-field/id #uuid "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4"] [:db/add "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4" :answer-field/choices "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19"] [:db/add "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4" :answer-field/correct "8e9398dd-c94b-56d8-9bc6-4772b399fb19"] [:db/ensure "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" :question/id #uuid "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113"] [:db/add "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" :question/problem "Find the **exact** solution of the equation $e^{4+4y}=25.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{4+4y}&=25 \\\\ \\ln(e^{4+4y})&=\\ln(25)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n4+4y=\\ln(25).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4+4y&=\\ln(25) \\\\ 4y&=\\ln(25)-4 \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\ln(25)-4\\right) \\\\ y&=-1+\\frac{1}{4}\\ln(25)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=-1+\\frac{1}{4}\\ln(25).$"] [:db/add "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" :question/answer-fields "38cacea6-d6f6-563e-be53-65ff3b067af4"] [:db/ensure "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/questions "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113"] [:db/add "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146" :answer/id #uuid "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146"] [:db/add "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146" :answer/value "\\frac{\\ln(11)+9}{5}"] [:db/ensure "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357" :answer-field/id #uuid "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357"] [:db/add "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357" :answer-field/choices "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146"] [:db/add "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357" :answer-field/correct "69814916-fde3-5a92-a267-34531a131146"] [:db/ensure "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69" :question/id #uuid "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69"] [:db/add "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69" :question/problem "Find the **exact** solution of the equation $e^{5y-9}=11.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{5y-9}&=11 \\\\ \\ln(e^{5y-9})&=\\ln(11)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n5y-9=\\ln(11).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5y-9&=\\ln(11) \\\\ 5y&=\\ln(11)+9 \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\ln(11)+9\\right) \\\\ y&=\\frac{9}{5}+\\frac{1}{5}\\ln(11)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=\\frac{9}{5}+\\frac{1}{5}\\ln(11).$"] [:db/add "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69" :question/answer-fields "2113adec-9496-52e2-9fa0-ad2cda8f3357"] [:db/ensure "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/questions "f9755790-72b4-5435-8b21-7c99371dbf69"] [:db/add "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad" :answer/id #uuid "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad"] [:db/add "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad" :answer/value "\\frac{\\ln(10)-3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2" :answer-field/id #uuid "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2"] [:db/add "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2" :answer-field/choices "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad"] [:db/add "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2" :answer-field/correct "49c9950d-5415-5b47-8499-e4c25278d5ad"] [:db/ensure "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" :question/id #uuid "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37"] [:db/add "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" :question/problem "Find the **exact** solution of the equation $e^{3+2y}=10.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{3+2y}&=10 \\\\ \\ln(e^{3+2y})&=\\ln(10)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n3+2y=\\ln(10).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3+2y&=\\ln(10) \\\\ 2y&=\\ln(10)-3 \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln(10)-3\\right) \\\\ y&=-\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(10)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=-\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(10).$"] [:db/add "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" :question/answer-fields "4585e6cc-0f8b-59e0-8f70-300fdb24aab2"] [:db/ensure "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/questions "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37"] [:db/add "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255" :answer/id #uuid "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255"] [:db/add "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255" :answer/value "\\frac{-7-\\ln(24)}{3}"] [:db/ensure "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255" :answer/validate] [:db/add "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba" :answer-field/id #uuid "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba"] [:db/add "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba" :answer-field/choices "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255"] [:db/add "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba" :answer-field/correct "977dc879-7c17-5a36-b2e3-e91bc3520255"] [:db/ensure "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0" :question/id #uuid "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0"] [:db/add "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0" :question/problem "Find the **exact** solution of the equation $e^{-3y-7}=24.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{-3y-7}&=24 \\\\ \\ln(e^{-3y-7})&=\\ln(24)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n-3y-7=\\ln(24).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3y-7&=\\ln(24) \\\\ -3y&=\\ln(24)+7 \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{-3}\\left(\\ln(24)+7\\right) \\\\ y&=-\\frac{7}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln(24)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=-\\frac{7}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln(24).$"] [:db/add "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0" :question/answer-fields "900f6ed8-142b-5e76-bda0-cbbfbeaca9ba"] [:db/ensure "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/questions "01270321-8636-5598-bf7d-e85808ad23b0"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "7ca38e8f-fd89-5109-a1fc-89beab22718a"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/4f/4f6f492f72497b9aae42bea543b7882ca119cbc4de3636e855cbb14b4c053374/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186087689 :knowledge-point/validate]]
